language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Order in which Harriet bought four pairs of shoes, and at which of four stores each pair was bought.
find ecruespadrilles, fuchsiaflats, purplepumps, suedesandals : int(1..4)
find footfarm, heelsinahandcart, theshoepalace, tootsies : int(1..4)

such that
$ the four shoe purchases occur at four different stops (each stop position holds one shoe)
allDiff([ecruespadrilles, fuchsiaflats, purplepumps, suedesandals]),
$ the four stores are visited at four different stops (each stop position holds one store)
allDiff([footfarm, heelsinahandcart, theshoepalace, tootsies]),
$ Harriet bought fuchsia flats at Heels in a Handcart
fuchsiaflats = heelsinahandcart,
$ the store she visited just after buying her purple pumps was not Tootsies
purplepumps + 1 != tootsies,
$ The Foot Farm was Harriet's second stop
footfarm = 2,
$ two stops after leaving The Shoe Palace, Harriet bought her suede sandals
theshoepalace + 2 = suedesandals
